SUMMARY:St. Giles\, Ab (sp)
DESCRIPTION:Vestment Color: White\n\nTwelve Holy Brothers\, Mm\n\nHistorica
 l note — Father Lasance Missal: St. Giles founded a celebrated monastery
  near Nîmes and became widely invoked by pilgrims in the Middle Ages.
